<title>USA: FTC seeks more info on Columbus McKinnon/Yale deal.</title>
<headline>FTC seeks more info on Columbus McKinnon/Yale deal.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.Y. 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbus McKinnon Corp said the U.S. Federal Trade Commission requested addition information on its $24 a share cash tender offer for Yale International Inc.</p>
<p>Columbus McKinnon announced plans to acquire Yale, formerly known as Spreckels Industries Inc, on August 26.</p>
<p>Columbus McKinnon, which manufactures material handling, lifting and positioning products, was not immediately available to comment on the type of information requested by the FTC.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
